<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 21.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 21.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Wednesday, May 21:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,575.90 (1,674.70)	CHF  1,120.40 (1,176.20)</p>
<p>    DEM    928.91 (983.61)	  GBP  2,588.10 (2,743.50)</p>
<p>    ATS    132.00 (139.76)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Tuesday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $25.01 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$16.10 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $41.11 million ($42.83 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
